<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova trade gap narrowed to $29.9 mln in Jan.</title>
<headline>Moldova trade gap narrowed to $29.9 mln in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's foreign trade deficit narrowed to $29.9 million in January 1997 from $31.2 million in January 1996, an official from the State Statistics Department told Reuters.</p>
<p> MOLDOVAN FOREIGN TRADE		 Jan '97	 Jan '96</p>
<p>    Exports				   47.1	    42.4</p>
<p>    Imports				   77.0	    73.6</p>
<p>    Balance				  -29.9	   -31.2</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in millions of dollars. In 1996 the total foreign trade deficit amounted to $277.6 million after $80.6 million in 1995.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
